+## Re-run on a new machine
+
+Follow [SFPI HANDOFF.md](https://github.com/tenstorrent/sfpi/blob/nkapre/sfpi/HANDOFF.md#reproducing-a-recorded-run)
+for the fresh-clone/setup path, portable `reproduce.env`, harness symlink
+check, setup-state location and manifest-derived OFF/ON command. No prior
+source-bundle export or original node directory is required. The archived
+absolute paths below are historical evidence, not runnable paths on your host.
+This recipe is supplied by the portability patch carried on SFPI's source
+branch; it changes no archived manifest, timing, ELF inventory or measurement.
+
